rt-docs-copy.spec.md","matches":[{"line_number":16,"content":"### FR-1: Surface-aware collected path — one derivation"},{"line_number":23,"content":"  - AC-1.1: `_collected_path(project_root=r, feature=\"f\", phase=\"plan\", cycle=8, index=1)` and"},{"line_number":25,"content":"  - AC-1.2: `_collected_path(..., cycle=8, index=1, surface=\"codex\")` returns a `Path` ending"},{"line_number":28,"content":"  - AC-1.3: A `surface` that does not match the single dot-free token grammar"},{"line_number":31,"content":"  - AC-1.4: `collect(spec, ..., surface=\"codex\")` writes its collected file at the AC-1.2 path;"},{"line_number":34,"content":"  - AC-1.5: among the WRITE-path modules (`h_mad_audit_cycle.py`, `h_mad_collect_report.py`)"},{"line_number":40,"content":"  - AC-1.6: **Disjoint namespace, proven by property, not by a production assert.** A"},{"line_number":52,"content":"### FR-2: `h_mad_collect_report.py` — the codex-leg collector"},{"line_number":76,"content":"  - AC-2.1: With `<RP>` present, non-empty, `<RP>.done` present, and no existing docs file:"},{"line_number":79,"content":"  - AC-2.2: With `<RP>` absent and no `--out` (or `--out` absent/empty): prints"},{"line_number":82,"content":"  - AC-2.3: With `<RP>` present but `<RP>.done` absent, and `--grace 0`: verdict is `MISSING`"},{"line_number":84,"content":"  - AC-2.4: With the docs file already present and byte-identical to `<RP>`: `COLLECT: OK …"},{"line_number":86,"content":"  - AC-2.5: With the docs file already present and DIFFERENT from `<RP>`: `COLLECT: CONFLICT"},{"line_number":90,"content":"  - AC-2.6: With `<RP>` absent and `--out <out>` present containing a sentinel-wrapped report"},{"line_number":93,"content":"  - AC-2.6a: `<RP>` absent, `--out` valid, docs file present with DIFFERENT bytes →"},{"line_number":96,"content":"  - AC-2.6b: `<RP>` absent, `--out` valid, docs file present and identical to the extracted"},{"line_number":98,"content":"  - AC-2.7: `--surface p2` (or any `p\\d+`) → exit 2, stderr names the token, no `COLLECT:` line."},{"line_number":100,"content":"  - AC-2.8: When `--report` resolves (`Path.resolve()`) to the derived docs path itself:"},{"line_number":104,"content":"  - AC-2.9: **Incident replay** (suite test, synthetic bytes) — in an isolated project root"},{"line_number":112,"content":"  - AC-2.10: Operational errors exit 2 and print **no** `COLLECT:` line: `--project-root`"},{"line_number":115,"content":"  - AC-2.12: Readback: with the writer patched to land wrong bytes (test seam), the CLI"},{"line_number":118,"content":"  - AC-2.11: Existing-identical docs file with `--surface` given and `<RP>.done` absent →"},{"line_number":122,"content":"### FR-3: The gate refuses a transport file"},{"line_number":149,"content":"  - AC-3.1: `h_mad_audit_gate.py /tmp/audit_f_plan_cycle3_codex.report.md` on a well-formed"},{"line_number":154,"content":"  - AC-3.2: The same bytes at `docs/01-plan/features/f.plan.audit.v3.codex.md` gate normally"},{"line_number":156,"content":"  - AC-3.3: `h_mad_audit_cycle.gate()` handed a transport-stem path returns"},{"line_number":159,"content":"  - AC-3.4: `h_mad_do_preconditions.py` is unaffected: it reads docs paths only (existing"},{"line_number":161,"content":"  - AC-3.5: The refusal is by **basename grammar**, not directory: `audit_f_plan_cycle3_codex.report.md`"},{"line_number":167,"content":"  - AC-3.5a: **Shared corpus, both directions** — one fixture list of names with an expected"},{"line_number":180,"content":"  - AC-3.7: **Verdict preservation** — for every `*.audit.v*.md` under this repo's `docs/`"},{"line_number":183,"content":"  - AC-3.6: A Phase-7 report path (`docs/04-report/features/x.report.md` with gate sections)"},{"line_number":186,"content":"### FR-4: `hmad-dispatch collect-report` wrapper verb"},{"line_number":190,"content":"  - AC-4.1: `hmad-dispatch collect-report <args…>` execs `python3 <here>/h_mad_collect_report.py"},{"line_number":194,"content":"  - AC-4.2: The verb is listed in 