{"type":"thought","data":"The plan's assumption"}
{"type":"thought","data":" table cites specific"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line numbers and behaviors"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from 2026-09-02."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe code has evolved"}
{"type":"thought","data":" significantly since"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2026-09-02. The feature"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is now implemented,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and later changes like"}
{"type":"thought","data":" unscorable reports "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and gated=N have been"}
{"type":"thought","data":" added. The audit must"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verify whether the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"plan's current-code "}
{"type":"thought","data":"citations remain accurate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" enough to mislead an"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implementer. The reviewer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" role is adversarial"}
{"type":"thought","data":" consistency with Axis"}
{"type":"thought","data":" C spec reconciliation."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit must compare"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the PLAN text directly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" against the SPEC text."}
{"type":"thought","data":" It should verify load-bearing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" assumptions against"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the current code tree,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not merely accept that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the feature exists."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Some assumption table"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claims describe pre-feature"}
{"type":"thought","data":" behavior and may be"}
{"type":"thought","data":" outdated."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's assumption"}
{"type":"thought","data":" table cites pre-feature"}
{"type":"thought","data":" behaviors such as \"grep"}
{"type":"thought","data":" codex.md → 0\" and no"}
{"type":"thought","data":" transport gating. These"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are false against the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" current tree, but they"}
{"type":"thought","data":" describe the gap the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan intends to close"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than claims "}
{"type":"thought","data":"that must remain true"}
{"type":"thought","data":" after implementation."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The audit should read"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the tree before asserting"}
{"type":"thought","data":" what is in it."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit should verify"}
{"type":"thought","data":" existing platform constraints"}
{"type":"thought","data":" such as APIs, signatures,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and regexes. A load-bearing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claim is the GATE_RE"}
{"type":"thought","data":" shape: the plan requires"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exact `must` and `should`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" counts, but the code"}
{"type":"thought","data":" allows optional trailing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fields."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's `GATE: "}
{"type":"thought","data":"INVALID must=0 should=0`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" token still matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the current regex, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"but the claim that it"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requires an exact shape"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is stale. The plan "}
{"type":"thought","data":"does not ask to modify"}
{"type":"thought","data":" GATE_RE.\n\nThe plan "}
{"type":"thought","data":"claims `unlink` appears"}
{"type":"thought","data":" at lines 92 and 169."}
{"type":"thought","data":" In the current tree,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" both copy and write"}
{"type":"thought","data":" now route through `_finalize_write`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" at line 271."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe stale `unlink`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" line numbers were evidence"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that both rungs clobbered."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan uses this "}
{"type":"thought","data":"to justify placing overwrite"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on both. The current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" code already has overwrite"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on both, so the citation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is outdated. The audit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" treats the plan as "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the artifact under review"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the tree as the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" base or result."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThis is cycle 1 of"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a plan audit. The orchestrator"}
{"type":"thought","data":" references prior audits"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and AC-2.9 replay. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"The sandbox contains"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the full skills repo"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with later implementation."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan may be an "}
{"type":"thought","data":"outdated document in"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a moving repository."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will verify the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"plan file on disk matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the inlined prompt "}
{"type":"thought","data":"exactly. I am now reading"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the full plan and the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" spec's functional requirement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" sections to perform"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Axis C reconciliation."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nA potential must-fix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" has emerged: success"}
{"type":"thought","data":" criteria 25 appears"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to contradict the enumerated"}
{"type":"thought","data":" list, which contains"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only 23 items (a through"}
{"type":"thought","data":" l'). This is a measurement-level"}
{"type":"thought","data":" inconsistency."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe 25-success-criterion"}
{"type":"thought","data":" count directly conflicts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with FR-6's 23-item"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requirement. This is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a hard internal contradiction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on a success gate. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"Count contradictions"}
{"type":"thought","data":" were previously treated"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as audit fixes that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" did not change plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" decisions, so this "}
{"type":"thought","data":"may be a must-fix or"}
{"type":"thought","data":" should-fix."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe 25-success-criterion"}
{"type":"thought","data":" count creates a hard"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gap because an implementer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cannot satisfy both"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the done-check and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the 23-item mutation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" list. This is a must-fix."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The measurement class"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is correct because "}
{"type":"thought","data":"fixing the number requires"}
{"type":"thought","data":" no tree changes."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe 25-success-criterion"}
{"type":"thought","data":" count may be a Should-fix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than Must-fix."}
{"type":"thought","data":" FR-6 and the deliverables"}
{"type":"thought","data":" correctly specify 23"}
{"type":"thought","data":" items, so a careful"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reader resolves the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" discrepancy from the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" detailed list. The "}
{"type":"thought","data":"sweep instruction targets"}
{"type":"thought","data":" real issues, not summary"}
{"type":"thought","data":" errors. It will be "}
{"type":"thought","data":"classified as Should-fix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" measurement if the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"contract is unambiguous,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or Must-fix only if"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it would cause a failed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" success check.\n\nThe 25-success-criterion"}
{"type":"thought","data":" count is now classified"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as Must-fix class: "}
{"type":"thought","data":"measurement. This is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a completion gate that"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cannot be satisfied"}
{"type":"thought","data":" alongside the 23-item"}
{"type":"thought","data":" mutation list. The "}
{"type":"thought","data":"reviewer must tag the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" bullet explicitly, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"since untagged bullets"}
{"type":"thought","data":" are scored as build."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe GATE_RE regex "}
{"type":"thought","data":"claim is dated evidence"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from 2026-09-02. It"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a point-in-time "}
{"type":"thought","data":"probe, so the exact "}
{"type":"thought","data":"pattern is acceptable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as historical context."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's assumption"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that the gate regex"}
{"type":"thought","data":" remains unchanged from"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2026-09-02 is now false."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The current regex accepts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tokens the old one "}
{"type":"thought","data":"rejected, so no code"}
{"type":"thought","data":" change is required."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The real risk is an"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implementer reverting"}
{"type":"thought","data":" GATE_RE to the old "}
{"type":"thought","data":"form. The plan deliberately"}
{"type":"thought","data":" avoids modifying the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" audit cycle's dispatch."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe GATE_RE regex "}
{"type":"thought","data":"discrepancy is a Should-fix"}
{"type":"thought","data":" measurement. The cited"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pattern no longer matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the tree, so later "}
{"type":"thought","data":"readers re-deriving "}
{"type":"thought","data":"it will disagree.\n\nThe"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan claims `_collected_path`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is only called from"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `audit_cycle.py`. In"}
{"type":"thought","data":" reality it is also "}
{"type":"thought","data":"called from `h_mad_collect_report.py`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan's risk mitigation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" assumes this was true"}
{"type":"thought","data":" before the feature "}
{"type":"thought","data":"existed."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe `_collected_path`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" signature is fully "}
{"type":"thought","data":"keyword-only in the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"current code. The plan's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" \"keyword-only surface=None\""}
{"type":"thought","data":" claim is accurate and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not a defect. The reviewer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is now comparing the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan and spec FR-3 "}
{"type":"thought","data":"sections to verify the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" feature slot stem."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan claims the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" recipe half is closed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" while the guard already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" landed in HemaSuite."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This contradicts Scope"}
{"type":"thought","data":" bullet 3, which includes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the gate. The reviewer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is now reading the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"overview to resolve "}
{"type":"thought","data":"this scope inconsistency."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe \"cannot-judge\""}
{"type":"thought","data":" pattern in `h_mad_new_gate.py`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" exits 0 with no counts."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The feature instead"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requires exit 2 and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" must=0 should=0. This"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradicts the \"Patterns"}
{"type":"thought","data":" followed\" strategy "}
{"type":"thought","data":"paragraph. It creates"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a hard gap between "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the cited pattern and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the Requirements section."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe reviewer will "}
{"type":"thought","data":"read `h_mad_new_gate.py`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the audit gate's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" transport refusal to"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verify whether the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"cited pattern is actually"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the correct contract"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for this gate."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nAC-6.1 omits explicit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" test coverage for AC-2.6a,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2.6b, 2.9, 2.10, 2.11,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 2.12, 1.5, and 1.6,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" but those items are"}
{"type":"thought","data":" covered elsewhere in"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan. This is not"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a gap.\n\nThe deliverables"}
{"type":"thought","data":" table includes all "}
{"type":"thought","data":"functional requirements"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from FR-1 through FR-6."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nA narrow restatement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of FR-3 is being checked:"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec uses `<feature>`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" while the plan uses"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `<stem>`.\n\nThe plan's COLLECT"}
