{"type":"thought","data":"A critical finding was"}
{"type":"thought","data":" identified on the feature"}
{"type":"thought","data":" slot."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe feature name is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" extracted by splitting"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the audit file path on the first dot. For"}
{"type":"thought","data":" transport files like"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `audit_f_plan_cycle3_codex.report.md`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this yields `audit_f_plan_cycle3_codex`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as the feature identifier."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan requires "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the feature slot to "}
{"type":"thought","data":"carry the dot-free transport"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stem verbatim. It is"}
{"type":"thought","data":" unclear whether this"}
{"type":"thought","data":" means removing only"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the `.report.md` suffix,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" or also stripping the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `audit_` prefix."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe dot-free transport"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stem is the basename"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with `.report.md` removed."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This matches the `split(\".\")[0]`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" result. The plan clarified"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that `[H-MAD] <feature>`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" uses this stem."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe same `split(\".\")[0]`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" logic handles both "}
{"type":"thought","data":"transport and docs files."}
{"type":"thought","data":" For docs files like"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `f.plan.audit.v3.codex.md`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it yields the feature"}
{"type":"thought","data":" name directly. This"}
{"type":"thought","data":" raises a question about"}
{"type":"thought","data":" whether the plan narrows"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec by requiring"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the stem while the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"spec calls for the feature."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe spec uses `<feature>`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" as a placeholder in"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the gate marker. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan v1.10 changed "}
{"type":"thought","data":"this to `<stem>`. This"}
{"type":"thought","data":" creates a direct conflict"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on Axis C."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe spec's `<feature>`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" placeholder is ambiguous."}
{"type":"thought","data":" It could be read as"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the actual parsed feature"}
{"type":"thought","data":" name, which is impossible"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to derive from a transport"}
{"type":"thought","data":" basename. The plan's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stem requirement resolves"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this ambiguity and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"creates a real contract"}
{"type":"thought","data":" divergence."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nAC-3.1 only checks"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that the marker line"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contains \"transport"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file\", so both the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"spec and plan could "}
{"type":"thought","data":"satisfy it. The plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is more specific than"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the spec, not narrower."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan is narrower"}
{"type":"thought","data":" than the spec. It restricts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the feature slot to"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the raw filename stem"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rather than a parsed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" feature identifier."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This divergence is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"must-fix under Axis "}
{"type":"thought","data":"C rules."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nA test filename mismatch"}
{"type":"thought","data":" was found: `test_h_mad_audit_cycle_slices.py`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" does not exist, while"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `test_h_mad_audit_cycle_docs.py`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is the correct file."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The anchor description"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the plan aligns "}
{"type":"thought","data":"with the actual test"}
{"type":"thought","data":" content: the heading"}
{"type":"thought","data":" prefix \"Putting\" matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the real text, and "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the `\\n7.` pattern matches"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the code's section "}
{"type":"thought","data":"search."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan's risk table"}
{"type":"thought","data":" names the wrong test"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file. It lists `test_h_mad_audit_cycle_slices.py`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" instead of the correct"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `test_h_mad_audit_cycle_docs.py`."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This is a plan defect"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that could cause the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" docs test to fail if"}
{"type":"thought","data":" an implementer follows"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the risk mitigation."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe wrong test filename"}
{"type":"thought","data":" prevents implementers"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from opening the actual"}
{"type":"thought","data":" test to verify anchors."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The risk table names"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a non-existent file,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so the mitigation points"}
{"type":"thought","data":" at the wrong target."}
{"type":"thought","data":" This is a build defect"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that breaks the plan's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" own test-establishment"}
{"type":"thought","data":" invariant."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe wrong test filename"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is a risk mitigation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" detail, not an FR. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"It creates an Axis A"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradiction between"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan, spec, and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tree. The plan text"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will be checked exactly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for that filename, "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and other locations "}
{"type":"thought","data":"will be searched for"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a renamed slices test."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe existing audit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gate already prints"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `GATE: INVALID must=0"}
{"type":"thought","data":" should=0` for missing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" sections before this"}
{"type":"thought","data":" feature. The plan's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pattern citation about"}
{"type":"thought","data":" \"cannot-judge carries"}
{"type":"thought","data":" no counts\" describes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" new_gate scaffolds,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not the existing audit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gate."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan incorrectly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" claims that every h-mad"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gate follows the new_gate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verdict-token contract."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The audit gate itself"}
{"type":"thought","data":" prints `must=0 should=0`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on INVALID, so it does"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not follow the \"no "}
{"type":"thought","data":"counts\" pattern. A careful"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implementer would rely"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on the specific requirement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in FR-3 rather than"}
{"type":"thought","data":" this generalization."}
