t import the regex — `_collected_path` and the tests do; collision candidates added to the AC-3.5a corpus."},{"line_number":287,"content":"- v1.1: Plan-audit v1 fixes (agy p1 + codex): collector contract (`CollectConflict`, `out_path` optional, `--force`); transport refusal narrowed to the `audit_*_cycle<N>*.report.md` stem — `*.report.md` collides with Phase-7 `<feature>.report.md`; recipe halts on non-`OK` `COLLECT:`; AC-2.9 is an incident replay; AC-2.10/2.11/3.6 added; AC-6.3 is 11 bidirectional mutations; AC-4.1 pinned by a wrapper wiring test."}]},{"path":"/Users/kimhawk/.local/state/h-mad/grok-audit-surface/run-ab2c85dc2e25-20261024T132452Z/roots/gas-root-d1-s1-szujeqyy/docs/01-plan/features/audit-report-docs-copy.plan.md","matches":[{"line_number":24,"content":"  (the one transport grammar: `audit_` prefix, dot-free stem, `.report.md` suffix) and"},{"line_number":26,"content":"  `<feature>.report.md`). Every refusal emits `[H-MAD] <feature> gate INVALID (transport"},{"line_number":52,"content":"- FR-3: gate refuses `TRANSPORT_RE` (`audit_` prefix, dot-free stem, `.report.md` suffix,"},{"line_number":54,"content":"  `_collected_path`) with exactly `GATE: INVALID must=0 should=0` + the `[H-MAD] <stem>"},{"line_number":55,"content":"  gate INVALID (transport file …)` marker (the feature slot carries the dot-free transport"},{"line_number":56,"content":"  stem verbatim — a transport name has no reliable feature grammar), exit 2; `<feature>.report.md` (Phase 7) still"},{"line_number":92,"content":"  reports are `<feature>.report.md`; the cycle-2 rule (a `_cycle<N>[_tok]` stem) was wrong"},{"line_number":96,"content":"  v1.3 grammar requires a **dot-free stem**: every docs audit name carries `.audit.v<N>`,"},{"line_number":147,"content":"| Transport names in the field always carry `audit_` + `.report.md`, NOT always `_cycle<N>` | `ls /tmp \\| grep -E '^audit_.*\\.report\\.md$'` (2026-09-02): 144 `_p1`, 129 `_p2`, 36 `_codex`, 14 `_agy`, 1 `_agy_p2`, and 7 hand-staged `audit_hnag_c28_agy.report.md` / `audit_hnag_implplan_c11.report.md` …; executed candidate regexes: the `_cycle<N>` stem matched 0 of those 7 and missed `_codex_draft`; `^audit_.*\\.report\\.md$` matched all |"},{"line_number":149,"content":"| Transport stems are dot-free; docs names always carry `.audit.v<N>` | executed 2026-09-02: `ls /tmp \\| grep -E '^audit_.*\\.report\\.md$' \\| grep -E '^audit_[^.]*\\..*\\.report\\.md$'` → 0 of 331; `^audit_[^.]+\\.report\\.md$` on `audit_f.plan.audit.v8.report.md` → False while `_VERSION_RE` → True; on `audit_hnag_c28_agy.report.md` → True / False; on `f.plan.audit.v8.p1.md` → False / True |"},{"line_number":216,"content":"- v1.3: Audit v3 fixes from .plan.audit.v3.p1.md (agy: [H-MAD] markers named in Requirements) + .v3.codex.md (TRANSPORT_RE stem is dot-free so the grammars are disjoint by construction; _collected_path asserts it, AC-1.6, 17 mutations; the CLI does not import the regex)."},{"line_number":223,"content":"- v1.10: Wording sweep from 5b-audit v10: the transport refusal marker's feature slot is the stem (matches design/impl-plan). No plan decision changed."}]}]},"locations":[]}
